Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["NewData", "ObjectName",
 CellID->196,ExpressionUUID->"cd07e53c-737e-4fb4-80a1-5906e240c43a"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"5ada00dd-3053-41fa-a124-0dd331ee6068"],
 Cell[BoxData[
  RowBox[{
   TemplateBox[{
     Cell[
      TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
     "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
    "PackageLink",
    BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"], "[", "]"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "b47c637f-dd88-4c88-938d-1eaa83350f3b"],
 "\[LineSeparator]creates a notebook holding the initialization cell that \
loads SolutionsX.\n",
 Cell["   ", "ModInfo",ExpressionUUID->"7878a8a7-d643-4e1d-a4ad-043074209d38"],
 "The cell carries no user identity and no absolute paths: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["LocateData"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/LocateData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "557086e9-f6c7-4a0c-882d-fc6d9da4a1fd"],
 "[] finds the data root relative to the notebook's own position; ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Alias"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Alias", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "45f94182-f269-4075-9761-563034771588"],
 " always comes from the user configuration."
}], "Usage",
 CellID->197,ExpressionUUID->"4cfb1043-37c6-457b-8da5-94b7260d9ca4"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "5ae0e673-3e68-4f63-a544-2254362223de"],
 "[] opens a fresh notebook and writes a single cell into it, marked as an \
initialization cell. It does not evaluate that cell: you do, and then start \
working in the notebook below it."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->198,ExpressionUUID->"663813ab-6616-415e-8e78-8289d2161f98"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The cell holds three lines -- load the package, LocateData[], and switch on \
parallel computation. It carries no absolute paths and no alias: when the \
notebook sits inside a Data entry directory (where ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SaveData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "a1301d06-65cc-4d1d-a598-c5b03e9ac8a7"],
 " puts it), or at a SolutionsX repository root (PacletInfo.wl beside a Data \
directory -- the Welcome notebook's position), LocateData[] derives ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$DataDirectory"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$DataDirectory", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "89aceaa5-609d-4521-9884-091c027c5ea3"],
 " from the notebook's own position, session-only; everywhere else the \
configured values apply unchanged."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->199,ExpressionUUID->"3b8d47f2-85c8-4b29-9b76-460864ab2d46"],

Cell["\<\
In a front end the package load itself prints nothing: LocateData[] is the \
single display point -- the Loaded: panel and the Data status line -- and it \
reproduces the same output on every evaluation.\
\>", "Notes",
 CellID->200,ExpressionUUID->"e67882c4-3766-4ce2-892a-02acbf80a671"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Identity is never written into the cell: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Alias"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Alias", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "77f25472-b6c3-4b87-a20b-4e98df628cba"],
 " always comes from the user configuration, so a notebook passed to another \
user reads its owner's entry but saves under theirs."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->201,ExpressionUUID->"6b13a15b-81e7-4138-9d6d-95e8bbe6461e"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["EnableParallelComputations"]], 
    "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/EnableParallelComputations", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "2d4db9a3-eaf0-4c67-b0f7-c8f4a699a6b7"],
 "[] is included so the notebook is ready for parallel work from the outset: \
it defines Global`applyMaps, which is what lets ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Compute"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/Compute", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "73c510de-fb4b-4054-8da0-10058bed2ba6"],
 " honour the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["ParallelMap"]], "paclet:ref/ParallelMap"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "77eabc79-4a28-4fc1-b3ed-92188ee3f9d2"],
 " entries of ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["$Apply"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/$Apply", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "9f064364-5edf-4231-a50d-24138e55b4c3"],
 ". Without it those entries are inert and only the ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["Map"]], "paclet:ref/Map"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "0680ac86-c0cf-46b1-8870-7248d965fab8"],
 " entries apply."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->202,ExpressionUUID->"135260eb-af8b-4f8c-a71d-282360e3d6be"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "Marking the cell ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["InitializationCell"]], "paclet:ref/InitializationCell"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "9c4667b8-1cab-4bd9-bc5a-075ceca95ce7"],
 " -> ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["True"]], "paclet:ref/True"},
   "RefLink",
   BaseStyle->{"InlineFormula"}]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "13235d75-58dd-488c-a77a-a7985e37f653"],
 " is what makes a stored entry self-restoring: whenever the notebook is \
reopened, the front end offers to evaluate it, which puts back the package \
and points the session at the data tree the notebook lives in."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->203,ExpressionUUID->"fda76ca3-3fe6-4926-9fa5-b25b43437bbb"],

Cell[TextData[{
 "The intended cycle is: ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "04fda9bc-1814-436f-bf4a-18adf154e398"],
 "[], evaluate the initialization cell, build the solution, then ",
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["SaveData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/SaveData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "ee62b21f-2e82-4ea8-bff3-31c940ddd253"],
 ", which writes the data and this notebook side by side into the entry \
directory."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->204,ExpressionUUID->"92d5bb34-a8b3-4e2e-8b87-914d5f6e6555"],

Cell[TextData[{
 Cell[BoxData[
  TemplateBox[{
    Cell[
     TextData["NewData"]], "paclet:VasilDimitrov/SolutionsX/ref/NewData", 
    "VasilDimitrov Package Symbol"},
   "PackageLink",
   BaseStyle->"InlineFormula"]], "InlineFormula",
  FontFamily->"Source Sans Pro",ExpressionUUID->
  "789851ab-83ea-46c9-b18c-1a7011094cbb"],
 " requires a front end, and returns nothing useful -- its effect is the new \
notebook."
}], "Notes",
 CellID->205,ExpressionUUID->"127a58f8-f45a-475f-a01e-7a254ff44192"]
}, Open  ]],

